      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA NEGOTIATE (7) got around the 537m at this track to take a Grade 4/5 in a solid 31.64 for a 2.25 lengths success. Hot win latest and looks the one to beat again. ZARA'S SECRET (4) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Scored over 312m at this track last time in a Grade 2/3 (17.95). Strike rate this distance strong having won six of 12 tries. Can make it two on the bounce. ONTARIO (2) is a well performed dog and winner of 14 races who was in the minor money last time out at this track (22.44). Form here at the trip sound including nine wins. Hard to beat again. ALTOCUMULUS (1) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
